<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38816" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prō-mūtŭus</span></b> ,
			a, um, adj., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>paid over beforehand</i>, <i>advanced</i>, <i>loaned</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">publicanis (imperabatur) insequentis anni
					vectigal promutuum,</span>”
				<i>was demanded in advance as a loan</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Caes.
					B. C. 3, 32 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			 (for which before: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">insequentis anni mutua pecunia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 3, 31, 2</span></i>
			): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vectura,</span>”
				<i>prepaid</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					19, 2, 15</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">prōmūtŭum</span></b> ,
			i, n., <i>an advance</i>,
				<i>loan</i>, <i><span class="en">Dig. 40, 7, 40, § 5</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
